Approval request for ticket ##{ticket.number}

<div>Hi #{recipient.firstname},</div>
<br>
<div>You have received an approval request for ticket ##{ticket.number}.</div>
<br>
<div>
Ticket: ##{ticket.number}<br>
Title: #{ticket.title}<br>
Status: #{approval.status}<br>
Priority: #{approval.priority}<br>
Requester: #{approval.requester_name}<br>
Approver: #{approval.approver_name}<br>
<% if approval.message.present? %>
Message: #{approval.message}<br>
<% end %>
</div>
<br>
<div>
  <a href="#{config.http_type}://#{config.fqdn}/#ticket/zoom/#{ticket.id}" target="zammad_app">View this in #{config.product_name}</a>
</div>